  "last_message": "I added a runbook so the next on-call volunteer doesn't need Tom\u00e1s:\n\n- `docs/runbooks/receipts-stopped.md` \u2014 new runbook, same shape as `gateway-timeouts.md`: check the worker (deploy script doesn't restart it), count `procrastinate_jobs` by status, start the worker, watch `todo` drain to 0, and what to do (and that failed/bounced-email jobs are expected and not a problem) if it doesn't resolve.\n- `docs/runbooks/README.md` \u2014 linked the new runbook.\n- `docs/architecture.md` \u2014 noted the worker isn't restarted by the deploy script and linked to the runbook, since that's the root cause and wasn't documented anywhere.\n\n`notes/chat-receipts.md` is now encoded as a durable runbook rather than a one-off chat log that only Tom\u00e1s could point people to.",
